b19788de031d633cf2163de4c 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is Mairo Utabori from Vsinger🌸.\nI found your illustration on Twitter and would like to ask if I could draw an illustration for you!\n\nWhat I would like you to draw is an original model child that I am working on.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/utahamairo/status/1654328319163375617?s=46&t=irdJ6I-4Q45moUGERIDAHw\n\nWe have two different colors and will leave it up to you.\nWe are planning to make a video with a YouTube thumbnail or a ballad song at the moment (the song will be TRUE COLORS), and we would like you to create an illustration with this image.\nReference URL: https://youtu.be/LZA58i7O1CA\n\nI would like to use it, and if possible, please provide a transparent file of the character: 🙇‍♂️", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "client_id": 2537597, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f448f7c6c700689eac40dfd35fa8640", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f448f7c6c700689eac40dfd35fa8640, https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9260d4acb3b776703074183ca9b694bd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc1d284a39a9d82c1dedc0fbf8ee51d8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0c5ed0d91e7375d176aa163f73651382", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0c5ed0d91e7375d176aa163f73651382, https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6cb642c5d9f5d5cee530f6439a0e63dc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f0531d9/uploads/origins/679f7747-fc00-4652-983e-f8206af3d236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3925dd89384974d13ca77085b1c329da 3x"}, "body": "My name is Rei Tsukigaki, and I am a Vtuber.\nI am a Vtuber and my name is Rei Tsukigaki. I saw some illustrations on Twitter of boys who are very cute, and I was wondering if you would be interested in doing some illustrations for us.\n\nIntended use\nThumbnails for SNS (Twitter, etc.) and YouTube\n\nRequests\nWe would appreciate it if you could deliver the PSD data with separate backgrounds, etc!\n\nRequests\nWe will leave the clothing, facial expressions and poses to you.\nIf possible, we would be happy if the head and other parts of the body are not cut off.\n\nThank you very much for your consideration!\nhttps://twitter.com/tukigaki_rei3/status/1682512263473958912?s=20\n\nhttps://twitter.com/tukigaki_rei3/status/1682512263473958912?s=20", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adb9b5e7a1449339028e79e257918a32", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=adb9b5e7a1449339028e79e257918a32, https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de81399163c4e18d0060c6f2e9808ad6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=002fa0e14b3b70bc179305bb767f6b68 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9e2e350f89036bf9382b7b3e19c2b33c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9e2e350f89036bf9382b7b3e19c2b33c, https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63c15571d8310fa7ff7888a71bea45fe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c087adaa/uploads/origins/efd8894a-a300-46c1-8921-d1e045f0d468?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=028059a7a1b97f77fedbf2e614273307 3x"}, "body": "初めまして、おはし様の描かれる中性的なキャラクターイラストがとても素敵でしたので是非依頼したいと思いお声掛けをさせていただきました。依頼内容は以下の通りです。\n\n■書いていただきたいキャラクター\n大正浪漫がテーマのキャラクターです。\nミステリアスな雰囲気を持っています。\n※以下Googleドライブにてご参照ください\n(カスタムキャストで作成したものであり、画像では女の子っぽさが強いですが中性(男より)に書いていただけると嬉しいです。)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/106OVHXE2NCG3yKlk4v4mOTIGf7ke90FA/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n■希望内容\nテーマ:祭りの夜(神社の境内、提灯など祭りを連想させるものを書いて欲しいです)\n服装、髪型なども必要に応じて変えていただいて構いません。目の柄(雪の結晶)は必ず入れて頂けると幸いです。\n\n■使用用途\n個人観賞用\n\n当方初めてのskebリクエストなので、不備等ありましたら申し訳ございません。 お忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討よろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2376329df308a06ae055a885d00f770", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2376329df308a06ae055a885d00f770, https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f0292ca29bf2bca5268652cc4b139e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76286abe749d5c36fdaf9ab8d26438ec 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c0dc24580eb71a76f17e95d7f7604cf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c0dc24580eb71a76f17e95d7f7604cf, https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=13587945b99ca336bb1135becfe50008 2x, https://si.imgix.net/51440d01/uploads/origins/888c7743-0aaa-4d59-8ef1-cde5502156ec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4328625fcef618a5284739be278bdca4 3x"}, "body": "初めまして。\n個人Vtuberのにゃほと申します。\n\nTwitterにてお見掛けし、ご依頼させて頂きたくリクエストをお送りしました！\n\n◆キャラクターの詳細\n・性別…女性\n・年齢…20代\n・身長体格…150cmくらい、細グラマー\n・髪型…ロング\n・髪の色…オレンジみ強めの金髪、毛先にエメラルドグリーンのグラデーションあり\n・服装…上半身:黒のノースリーブ＋ベージュのジップアップパーカー(大きめ) \n　　　　下半身:上のパーカーでお尻が隠れるくらい、下は履いていません\n・目の色…少しつり目、緑色\n・その他…口元:八重歯 / 装飾品:両耳ピアス、指に黒のリング \n・描画範囲…太もも上\n・ポーズ、イメージ…シガレット（煙草に見える）を加えて振り向いている感じでお願いいたします。八重歯が見えるように描いていただけると嬉しいです！\n・背景…指定はございません。お任せいたします。\n・その他備考…キャラクターのサンプル画像を参照資料として共有いたします。\n\n◆使用用途\n・YouTubeの配信や動画のサムネイル\n・Twitterでの告知\n\n◆納品データに関して\n可能であれば、透過素材と背景素材ありの物を頂きたいです。\n\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Yd69ijgZ-WjuL_Hw28n4MHgnFfXFPlXQ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "client_id": 2794349, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c54b813c/uploads/origins/a4f034e9-f7e1-43ca-97ee-930840d8d408?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ff6cb10d55d705de3f2557155b48ed3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c54b813c/uploads/origins/a4f034e9-f7e1-43ca-97ee-930840d8d408?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ff6cb10d55d705de3f2557155b48ed3, https://si.imgix.net/c54b813c/uploads/origins/a4f034e9-f7e1-43ca-97ee-930840d8d408?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2abe95d91d11b38f4e7c5613b18d79ec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c54b813c/uploads/origins/a4f034e9-f7e1-43ca-97ee-930840d8d408?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d17255794fd53be872f5eeeb7fef5ab5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c54b813c/uploads/origins/a4f034e9-f7e1-43ca-97ee-930840d8d408?bg=%23fff