is!)\n\nReference material URL] https://twitter.com/Makiya_Mau/status/1682600668572561414?s=20\n(I have a fixed tweet on Twitter with three views and a standing drawing.)\n(It has wings on its waist, but it can only float a little from the waist and can't fly)\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Makiya_Mau/status/1682600668572561414?s=20", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "client_id": 2380322, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/uploads/origins/f4452ad6-2ffd-47ff-a42b-b9607c08873f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dec860dcaf7c34adaada25deb3f068f4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/uploads/origins/f4452ad6-2ffd-47ff-a42b-b9607c08873f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dec860dcaf7c34adaada25deb3f068f4, https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/uploads/origins/f4452ad6-2ffd-47ff-a42b-b9607c08873f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9500dc22a460c68b5706046ded4a618e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/uploads/origins/f4452ad6-2ffd-47ff-a42b-b9607c08873f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cd6ba6dcd0b807996d6371273bf75d0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/uploads/origins/f4452ad6-2ffd-47ff-a42b-b9607c08873f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ab8f1aa26a2fcd21c5af670cad973f33", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/uploads/origins/f4452ad6-2ffd-47ff-a42b-b9607c08873f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ab8f1aa26a2fcd21c5af670cad973f33, https://si.imgix.net/683179ee/upl