　目：緑色、猫目\n　体：150センチ\n　\n　3人目\n　髪：桃色、ポニーテール\n　目：赤〜桃色、少しつり目\n　体：160センチ\n\n　②ポーズ（構図）\n　・寝ころびながらスマホを見ていたり、漫画または雑誌を読んでいたり、ブランケットに包まってうとうとしていたり、のんびりしている構図\n　(一緒にいるものの別々のことをしているイメージです。)\n\n　③納品に関する希望\n　・3人をそれぞれバラバラでも使えるようにレイヤーを分けていただけると助かります。\n　・簡易背景あり/背景透過版の2パターンいただきたいですが、難しいようでしたら簡易背景は無しでも構いません。\n　・サムネイルや動画で使用するにあたり、若干の色調調整についてご了承いただけますと嬉しいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ONdmCIXTzvhdY5pfiWypCIy8CRWg33M7?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ab15717/uploads/origins/752f5261-9f88-4f2b-ad5f-0e01185defe7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=77a535acd6a12148ef7a2439fe712632", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ab15717/uploads/origins/752f5261-9f88-4f2b-ad5f-0e01185defe7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=77a535acd6a12148ef7a2439fe712632, https://si.imgix.net/1ab15717/uploads/origins/752f5261-9f88-4f2b-ad5f-0e01185defe7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0740a090536ad8374af0ed94ff8754f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ab15717/uploads/origins/752f5261-9f88-4f2b-ad5f-0e01185defe7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b2ae672efd7165a0dc09f5952f594ce5 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "client_id": 2836205, "nc": 128}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "client_id": 2087543, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d131d5c1aa2c4d211bc974129bab3c63", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d131d5c1aa2c4d211bc974129bab3c63, https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=367a7518d4e6c7e27b073d8544f8e837 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26c75e46e4e28e24601194a5574400e8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c1c37a748e0cfb09ea668efafc9042cc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c1c37a748e0cfb09ea668efafc9042cc, https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=58b12ffbdca57ddf99325559f25db2ef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d9fc7dd9/uploads/origins/2ea9455c-8080-4577-964b-d609b987807c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7efc242b456ba200704ddba024b61eb4 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is Koko Nemuru, a personal Vtuber.\n\nI saw your advertisement on Twitter, and I would like to request your help!\n\nI am a personal Vtuber.\nI am a demon girl who loves to interact with people and thinks she is an angel although she has demon wings, horns and tail.\nShe is a boxed-in girl who has lived a spoiled life and has been sleeping for a long time and has no memory of her past.\n*I recently became able to change my devil element into angel rings and wings, making me an angel and devil girl.\n\n◆Usage\nThumbnails and icons for YouTube distribution and videos, and for use in community postings.\nUse as icons and announcements on Twitter.\nDiscord icon\n\nAbout illustrations\nThere is no particular theme or situation to be specified.\nWe would appreciate it if you could draw what you think is a cute moment of a fluffy girl!\nWe would like to leave the background to you as well.\n\n◆About layers\nIf possible, we would like to have a 350dpi image with transparency and background material.\nWe would appreciate it if you could draw the image in such a way that no part of the image is missing.\nWe would appreciate it if you could draw the image in such a way that no part of the image can be seen.\n\nWe look forward to working with you!\n\nMaterial to be drawn here▶\n　We would like you to draw Koko no Nemuru with devil's wings, horns, and tail as shown in the first page of the document.\n　She is 125cm tall, though not stated.\n　Fixed tweets on Twitter\n　https://twitter.com/nemuxre/status/1547576611259949056?s=21&t=QFIYiwUS1aiFZ1lVS4s05w\n　Birthday illustration (for reference of the design around the shoulder)\n　https://twitter.com/nemUxRe/status/1491064279973302275?s=20&t=CI61w1eadOcSBrCy17gRfA\n　You can also see the dress around her shoulders in the second short hair on the rightmost side of the Twitter fixed tweet.\n　●Skirt design\n　https://twitter.com/nemUxRe/status/1611372094507610112?s=20&t=CI61w1eadOcSBrCy17gRfA", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ktya_v/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2705054, "client_id": 710805, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeab07a0b4339e9ac15d3289f49c75df", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eeab07a0b4339e9ac15d3289f49c75df, https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4680d1fc3243b8ffffd380e05e8554c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2457f3eb505cea45ed50824391865867 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b94e43e1dd50b6ec37121dfdc6d12761", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b94e43e1dd50b6ec37121dfdc6d12761, https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ca069999f9640be5987b8e5ce52266bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9d1bb56b/uploads/origins/e63bd808-e165-4431-8385-9650757e8432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ee5d10665c7826d8305dcf5cbdaa1eef 3x"}, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you ^^ I really love all your art! From the Limbus Company to the Genshin artwork, it's all beautiful.\n\nPlease consider drawing my original character \"Anne.\" I've included her reference URL.\n\nPERSONALITY\n- Ambitious. Willing to do anything if it means reaching her goals.\n- The type of person to raise her eyebrows and drawl a deadpan insult.\n- While she is extremely loyal to those close to her, she tends to look down on strangers.\n- As someone who grew up in the upper class that was filled with lies, she gets flustered and embarrassed by sincerity.\n- She eventually learns how to trust people.\n\nDETAILS\n- I like your colored style, but I also like your monochrome sketches! Feel free to choose whatever style you'd like.\n- Any composition, clothes, etc. are fine.\n\nI leave everything to you! Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RJgwIsHtIbtcVX68NFW6nTPX7C3LWepT?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": 1781345528.708267}, {"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": 1781873203.413397}, {"amount": 9000, "recorded_at": 1782412016.952553}], "correction": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": 1781345528.708267}, {"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": 1781873203.413397}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": 1782412016.952553}]}, "custom": {}}